WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.516 --> 00:00:16.000
"I need to go to Mayor Bloom's office," Roxy thought.

2
00:00:16.580 --> 00:00:17.720
"People are missing."

3
00:00:19.101 --> 00:00:20.741
Roxy ran into Jack's backyard.

4
00:00:20.761 --> 00:00:22.141
"Hey, guys!"

5
00:00:22.481 --> 00:00:22.902
she said.

6
00:00:22.922 --> 00:00:26.523
"I need to Jack, Mara, and Terrell weren't there.

7
00:00:26.543 --> 00:00:28.643
"Where are they?"

8
00:00:28.923 --> 00:00:29.523
Roxy said.

9
00:00:30.544 --> 00:00:31.364
Then she shrugged.

10
00:00:32.092 --> 00:00:33.753
"They probably went into Jack's house."

11
00:00:37.294 --> 00:00:39.775
When Roxy arrived at the mayor's building, she gasped.

12
00:00:39.795 --> 00:00:41.936
"Another plant!"

13
00:00:43.057 --> 00:00:44.357
This plant was enormous.

14
00:00:45.178 --> 00:00:47.519
Its twisting vines crept up the side of the building.

15
00:00:47.979 --> 00:00:50.080
It had several large bulbs that seemed to move.

16
00:00:51.160 --> 00:00:53.061
Large pods hung from under the bulbs.

17
00:00:56.142 --> 00:00:57.643
Roxy went into Mayor Bloom's office.

18
00:00:58.523 --> 00:00:59.484
The mayor wasn't there.

19
00:01:00.424 --> 00:01:02.026
Roxy noticed the window was broken.

20
00:01:02.046 --> 00:01:04.488
"Where did he go?"

21
00:01:04.888 --> 00:01:05.369
she thought.

22
00:01:07.771 --> 00:01:09.433
Roxy flew over to police headquarters.

23
00:01:10.274 --> 00:01:12.356
Another plant was growing up the side of that building.

24
00:01:13.397 --> 00:01:15.158
"Where did all these plants come from?"

25
00:01:15.479 --> 00:01:16.139
Roxy thought.

26
00:01:17.460 --> 00:01:19.042
Detective Smith was in his office.

27
00:01:20.443 --> 00:01:22.045
He was looking at something on his computer.

28
00:01:22.065 --> 00:01:24.207
"Hey, Detective!"

29
00:01:24.467 --> 00:01:25.048
Roxy said.

30
00:01:26.264 --> 00:01:29.085
"I just saw your, um, garden outside.

31
00:01:29.485 --> 00:01:31.686
You really need to do some weeding!"

32
00:01:33.666 --> 00:01:35.247
Detective Smith rolled his eyes.

33
00:01:35.267 --> 00:01:37.827
"Very funny, Rocket Girl.

34
00:01:38.147 --> 00:01:40.048
I have no idea what that plant is.

35
00:01:40.388 --> 00:01:41.488
It's very creepy.

36
00:01:41.828 --> 00:01:42.469
I don't like it."

37
00:01:43.469 --> 00:01:44.969
"So, what are you watching, Detective?"

38
00:01:45.289 --> 00:01:45.949
Roxy asked.

39
00:01:45.969 --> 00:01:52.711
"Cartoons?" Detective Smith looked up at her.

40
00:01:53.351 --> 00:01:54.912
"You're making a lot of jokes today.

41
00:01:55.296 --> 00:01:56.636
This is a security video."

42
00:01:57.257 --> 00:01:58.937
He moved over so Roxy could get a look.

43
00:02:01.618 --> 00:02:06.039
"Several people went missing near the corner of West Street and River Drive," the detective said.

44
00:02:06.059 --> 00:02:08.700
"This video is from a camera there."

45
00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:12.581
Roxy watched cars and trucks drive through the intersection.

46
00:02:13.201 --> 00:02:14.622
People walked along the sidewalk.

47
00:02:15.982 --> 00:02:18.403
Suddenly a woman looked up and pointed at something.

48
00:02:19.143 --> 00:02:20.463
The video didn't have sound.

49
00:02:21.263 --> 00:02:23.184
But Roxy could tell the woman was scared.

50
00:02:24.584 --> 00:02:25.384
Other people looked up.

51
00:02:26.144 --> 00:02:27.425
They screamed and ran off.

52
00:02:28.105 --> 00:02:30.506
Then a twisting vine moved past the camera.

53
00:02:31.266 --> 00:02:32.686
After that the video went black.

54
00:02:32.706 --> 00:02:37.288
"That was weird," Roxy said.

55
00:02:39.368 --> 00:02:40.809
Detective Smith looked out the window.

56
00:02:41.909 --> 00:02:44.149
One of the giant plant's bulbs blocked the sun.

57
00:02:45.450 --> 00:02:46.350
He scratched his head.

58
00:02:46.370 --> 00:02:49.151
"I don't like those plants.

59
00:02:49.651 --> 00:02:51.131
Where did they come from anyway?"

60
00:02:52.052 --> 00:02:53.072
Roxy's watch beeped.

61
00:02:54.236 --> 00:02:55.136
She quickly answered it.

62
00:02:55.156 --> 00:02:57.977
"Mayor Bloom?"

63
00:02:59.238 --> 00:02:59.918
"Rocket Girl!"

64
00:03:00.238 --> 00:03:00.898
It was Terrell.

65
00:03:00.918 --> 00:03:04.740
"Remember that plant in Jack's backyard?"

66
00:03:05.780 --> 00:03:06.500
Roxy sighed.

67
00:03:06.520 --> 00:03:08.661
"Of course I remember it.

68
00:03:09.121 --> 00:03:10.262
I'm busy right now, though.

69
00:03:10.562 --> 00:03:11.162
What's wrong?"

70
00:03:11.182 --> 00:03:13.703
"A lot is wrong!"

71
00:03:13.883 --> 00:03:14.483
Terrell said.

72
00:03:14.503 --> 00:03:16.984
"That plant ate us!"
